In this version, the data is intended for teaching GIS courses at the Faculty of Environmental Sciences, Czech University of Life Sciences in Prague.</idCredit><tpCat><TopicCatCd value="018"/></tpCat><tpCat><TopicCatCd value="017"/></tpCat></dataIdInfo><dqInfo><dqScope><scpLvl><ScopeCd value="005"/></scpLvl></dqScope><report type="DQConcConsis"><measDesc>The shapefile is converted to file geodatabase (FGDB) format using tools in ArcGIS. The geometry is checked, and if needed repaired.</measDesc></report><report type="DQCompOm"><measDesc>After processing, the data set is checked for drawing display and number of records and file sizes compared with source materials.</measDesc></report><report type="DQAbsExtPosAcc" dimension="horizontal"><measDesc>The DWBM was derived using Landsat 7 (Global Land Survey (GLS) 2000 and GLS 2005) and SRTM (Shuttle Radar Topography Mission) as a global base. Landsat 7 provided the horizontal positional accuracy of +/- 50 meters 90% CE, and SRTM ensured that features appropriately fit the topography (i.e. rivers flowed through valleys).</measDesc></report><dataLineage><dataSource type="" xmlns=""><srcDesc>Attribute and geospatial data</srcDesc><srcScale><rfDenom>1000000</rfDenom></srcScale><srcCitatn xmlns=""><resTitle>Roads</resTitle><resAltTitle>DeLorme World Base Map 2013</resAltTitle><date><pubDate>2013-12-01T00:00:00</pubDate></date><resEd>2013</resEd><citRespParty xmlns=""><rpOrgName>DeLorme Publishing Company, Inc.</rpOrgName><role><RoleCd value="006"/></role></citRespParty><citRespParty xmlns=""><rpOrgName>DeLorme Publishing Company, Inc.</rpOrgName><rpCntInfo><cntAddress><delPoint>Yarmouth, Maine, USA</delPoint></cntAddress></rpCntInfo><role><RoleCd value="010"/></role></citRespParty><presForm xmlns=""><PresFormCd value="005"/><fgdcGeoform>vector digital data</fgdcGeoform></presForm><datasetSeries><seriesName>A subset of DeLorme World Base Map (DWBM).</seriesName><issId>2013</issId></datasetSeries><citOnlineRes xmlns=""><linkage>http://www.delorme.com/</linkage></citOnlineRes></srcCitatn><srcExt xmlns=""><exDesc>publication date</exDesc><tempEle><TempExtent><exTemp><TM_Instant><tmPosition>2013-12-01T00:00:00</tmPosition></TM_Instant></exTemp></TempExtent></tempEle></srcExt><srcMedName><MedNameCd value="003"/></srcMedName></dataSource><prcStep xmlns=""><stepDesc>The following steps were performed by Esri: Extracted the FGDB feature class from the subset of DeLorme World Base Map (DWBM). Added field TYPE and calculated its values using the source DFCC code and descriptive look up table. Renamed source field ACC to RANK. Added field RD_FEATURE and calculated its values based on source fields Is_Tunnel, Is_Bridge, and Is_Causeway. Deleted all fields except ISO_CC, NAME1, NAME2, NAME3, NAME4, NAME5, SHIELD, TYPE, RANK, and RD_FEATURE. Dissolved features on all fields to reduce the number of features.</stepDesc><stepDateTm>2014-01-15T00:00:00</stepDateTm><stepSrc type="used" xmlns=""><srcCitatn xmlns=""><resAltTitle>DeLorme World Base Map 2013</resAltTitle></srcCitatn></stepSrc></prcStep></dataLineage></dqInfo><mdHrLvName Sync="TRUE">dataset</mdHrLvName><refSysInfo><RefSystem><refSysID><identCode code="3035" Sync="TRUE"/><idCodeSpace Sync="TRUE">EPSG</idCodeSpace><idVersion Sync="TRUE">6.7(9.0.0)</idVersion></refSysID></RefSystem></refSysInfo><spatRepInfo><VectSpatRep><geometObjs Name="roads_SR"><geoObjTyp><GeoObjTypCd value="002" Sync="TRUE"></GeoObjTypCd></geoObjTyp><geoObjCnt Sync="TRUE">0</geoObjCnt></geometObjs><topLvl><TopoLevCd value="001" Sync="TRUE"></TopoLevCd></topLvl></VectSpatRep></spatRepInfo><mdDateSt Sync="TRUE">20241220</mdDateSt></metadata>
